  <title>SET ANSI Command (FoxPro)</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET ANSI command</keyword>
    <keyword>SET ANSI command<keyword>FoxPro</keyword></keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
